WEBVTT

00:00:06.077 --> 00:00:07.948
What do you say, Branch?

00:00:10.951 --> 00:00:12.779
[ALL GASP]Oh, my God.

00:00:12.823 --> 00:00:15.303
I wouldn't be caught dead
at your party,
but you will be.

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:16.914
Caught and dead.

00:00:16.957 --> 00:00:18.219
CREEK: Whoa, whoa.

00:00:18.263 --> 00:00:20.178
Easy, Branch. Easy.

00:00:22.658 --> 00:00:25.270
Thank you for providing
safe passage, brother.

00:00:25.313 --> 00:00:26.793
Namaste.

00:00:26.837 --> 00:00:29.665
Okay, first of all, mate,
thanks for sharing

00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:31.624
your unique perspective
on things.

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:32.799
Again.

00:00:32.843 --> 00:00:34.105
[SNICKERING]

00:00:34.148 --> 00:00:35.410
But, just for now,
why don't you try on

00:00:35.454 --> 00:00:36.934
some positivity, eh?

00:00:36.977 --> 00:00:39.806
A little positivity
might go with that vest.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.112
Okay, fine.

00:00:41.155 --> 00:00:44.463
I'm positive you all
are going to get eaten.

00:00:44.506 --> 00:00:45.681
[CHIMING]

00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:47.771
Hug time!It is hug time.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:49.816
ALL: Hug time!

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.905
Oh, that feels good.Our hearts are synchronizing!

00:00:51.949 --> 00:00:54.299
♪ I can squeeze you forever

00:00:54.342 --> 00:00:56.649
[BRANCH GRUNTING]

00:00:56.692 --> 00:00:58.912
Someday,
when the Bergens find us...

00:00:58.956 --> 00:01:01.654
and the survival of every
Troll is in your hands...

00:01:01.697 --> 00:01:02.829
I sure hope the answer

00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:04.265
is singing, dancing,
and hugging...

00:01:04.309 --> 00:01:05.963
because that's all you know
how to do.

00:01:06.006 --> 00:01:09.314
That is not true!
Poppy can also scrapbook.

00:01:09.357 --> 00:01:12.143
I can't believe
you're gonna be
queen one day.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:17.365
Tune out his
negative vibrations, Poppy.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:18.714
They're toxic.

00:01:18.758 --> 00:01:21.979
Some folks just
don't want to be happy.

00:01:22.022 --> 00:01:23.284
I guess.

00:01:23.328 --> 00:01:24.633
You guessed right.

00:01:24.677 --> 00:01:25.678
Boop.

00:01:26.722 --> 00:01:28.463
[ELECTRONIC MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:29.813
[TROLLS CHEERING]

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:31.162
Yeah!

00:01:34.165 --> 00:01:36.515
[GRUNTING]

00:01:36.558 --> 00:01:38.430
Whoo! I love you so much!

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:45.611
Yeah!

00:01:46.351 --> 00:01:47.874
Whoo! Glitter!

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:51.617
[ALL GASP][MUSIC STOPS]

00:01:53.227 --> 00:01:55.186
YOLO![MUSIC CONTINUES]

00:01:55.229 --> 00:01:56.578
[ALL CHEERING]

00:02:06.066 --> 00:02:07.067
[SCOFFS]

00:02:11.028 --> 00:02:12.246
More glitter!

00:02:14.727 --> 00:02:17.382
Turn it up!

00:02:26.782 --> 00:02:28.132
[FIREWORKS EXPLODING]

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.620
POPPY: I can't hear you![TROLLS CHEERING]

00:02:42.798 --> 00:02:44.931
Trolls.

00:02:44.975 --> 00:02:46.411
POPPY: Okay, everyone.

00:02:46.454 --> 00:02:48.587
I just want to
take a moment...

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.371
and get a little real.

00:02:50.415 --> 00:02:51.459
BIGGIE: Poppy!

00:02:51.503 --> 00:02:53.200
She's my friend!
I know her!

00:02:53.244 --> 00:02:54.723
[ALL SHUSHING][SQUEAKS]

00:02:54.767 --> 00:02:56.160
[KING PEPPY CLEARS THROAT]

00:02:56.203 --> 00:03:00.555
I'd like to take a second
to celebrate our king...

00:03:00.599 --> 00:03:02.557
my father...

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:04.951
who, 20 years ago
this night...

00:03:04.995 --> 00:03:07.780
saved all of us
from those dreaded...

00:03:07.823 --> 00:03:08.955
[LOUD FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING]

00:03:08.999 --> 00:03:09.956
[ALL GASPING]

00:03:12.654 --> 00:03:13.655
[CRASHING]

00:03:14.308 --> 00:03:15.483
Bergens.

00:03:18.138 --> 00:03:19.226
[ALL GASP]

00:03:20.749 --> 00:03:21.881
Gotcha.

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:27.669
Uh...

00:03:27.713 --> 00:03:28.844
Cupcake?

00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:34.633
Run![ALL CLAMORING]

00:03:34.676 --> 00:03:35.677
Run! Run!

00:03:36.461 --> 00:03:37.462
Poppy, help!

00:03:38.028 --> 00:03:39.159
Mr. Dinkles?

00:03:39.203 --> 00:03:41.161
Has anybody seen
Mr. Dinkles?[SQUEAKS]

00:03:41.205 --> 00:03:43.163
[YELPING]POPPY: Biggie!

00:03:43.207 --> 00:03:46.471
Blend in! Blend in!
Blend in!

00:03:46.514 --> 00:03:47.559
SCARED TROLL: Poppy!

00:03:47.602 --> 00:03:49.604
[GASPS]MALE TROLL: Run!

00:03:52.607 --> 00:03:53.739
POPPY: Run, Smidge!

00:03:53.782 --> 00:03:54.827
Oh, my God!

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.307
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.961
[BOTH SCREAMING]

00:03:58.004 --> 00:03:59.005
TROLL CHILD: Poppy, help!

00:03:59.049 --> 00:04:00.354
Hurry![SCREAMS]

00:04:00.398 --> 00:04:02.008
Go! Go! Go!

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:03.836
Phew... Whoa!

00:04:03.879 --> 00:04:04.968
Cooper!

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.882
CREEK: Everyone,
minimize your auras!

00:04:06.926 --> 00:04:08.406
[GASPS] Creek!No! Poppy!

00:04:09.189 --> 00:04:10.408
[GRUNTING]

00:04:10.451 --> 00:04:11.713
Hold on.Poppy!

00:04:12.888 --> 00:04:14.499
CREEK: No!Creek!

00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:16.022
[SCREAMING]MALE TROLL: Ow!

00:04:17.893 --> 00:04:19.330
Hmm.

00:04:19.373 --> 00:04:21.245
Bad Bergen!
Bad, bad Bergen.

00:04:21.288 --> 00:04:22.376
Ah...

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.074
[GASPS]Bad, bad Bergen!

00:04:24.117 --> 00:04:25.423
Dad!

00:04:25.466 --> 00:04:27.381
[CHEF GRUNTING]

00:04:27.425 --> 00:04:29.209
Whoa... [SIGHS][SHUSHING]

00:04:30.558 --> 00:04:31.777
[GROANS]

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.741
[SCOFFS]

00:04:43.832 --> 00:04:46.618
Thanks for throwing
the biggest...

00:04:46.661 --> 00:04:48.750
the loudest...

00:04:48.794 --> 00:04:50.926
The craziest party ever.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:51.971
[GROANING]

00:04:56.497 --> 00:04:57.803
[GRUNTS]

00:05:34.013 --> 00:05:36.102
Is it coming back?

00:05:36.146 --> 00:05:38.583
What are we gonna do now?

00:05:38.626 --> 00:05:41.325
We have to find a new home.
Everyone, hurry.

00:05:41.368 --> 00:05:43.675
We have to leave
before the Bergens come back.

00:05:43.718 --> 00:05:44.937
We have to rescue them.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.591
No, Poppy,
we have to run.

00:05:46.634 --> 00:05:48.245
Now, let's go, everyone.
Come on!

00:05:48.288 --> 00:05:51.552
What about
"No Troll left behind"?

00:05:52.814 --> 00:05:54.033
I'm sorry, Poppy.

00:05:54.077 --> 00:05:55.426
That was a long time ago.

00:05:55.469 --> 00:05:57.993
And I'm not the king
I once was.

00:05:59.995 --> 00:06:01.301
Then I'll go.

00:06:01.345 --> 00:06:02.998
I'll go and save them.

00:06:03.042 --> 00:06:05.653
No, Poppy.
It's too dangerous.

00:06:05.697 --> 00:06:07.264
I have to at least try.

00:06:07.307 --> 00:06:10.267
No. You can't go
to Bergen Town
by yourself.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:11.833
It's impossible.

00:06:17.012 --> 00:06:20.494
MALE TROLL ON RECORDING:
♪ Celebrate freedom
from the Bergens

00:06:22.496 --> 00:06:26.196
♪ Celebrate freedom
from the Bergens ♪

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.508
[KNOCKING ON DOOR][GASPS]

00:06:36.031 --> 00:06:37.163
[RECORDED MESSAGES
PLAYING SIMULTANEOUSLY]

00:06:37.207 --> 00:06:39.165
Branch, you're invited!

00:06:39.209 --> 00:06:40.427
No! No! No! [SHUSHING]

00:06:43.387 --> 00:06:44.823
Branch! Branch! Branch!

00:06:44.866 --> 00:06:46.477
Branch, are you
in there? Huh?

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.174
I'm not going to your party.

00:06:48.218 --> 00:06:49.306
The party's over.

00:06:49.349 --> 00:06:51.177
We just got
attacked by a Bergen.

00:06:51.221 --> 00:06:52.352
I knew it.

00:06:53.136 --> 00:06:54.137
[POPPY GASPS]

00:07:04.234 --> 00:07:05.713
Branch!Shh.

00:07:05.757 --> 00:07:07.846
I have to tell you something.Shh.

00:07:07.889 --> 00:07:08.890
I was just gonna...

00:07:08.934 --> 00:07:10.805
[TUTTING] Shh! Shh!

00:07:12.459 --> 00:07:13.678
What?

00:07:13.721 --> 00:07:15.201
What could be
so important that it's worth

00:07:15.245 --> 00:07:16.811
leading the Bergen
right to us?

00:07:16.855 --> 00:07:18.204
The Bergen's gone!

00:07:18.248 --> 00:07:19.945
You don't know that.
It could still be out there.

00:07:19.988 --> 00:07:21.033
Watching.

00:07:21.076 --> 00:07:22.208
Waiting.

00:07:22.252 --> 00:07:24.254
Listening.

00:07:24.297 --> 00:07:25.559
No. It left!

00:07:25.603 --> 00:07:28.214
It took Cooper, and Smidge,
and Fuzzbert...

00:07:28.258 --> 00:07:30.042
and Satin,
and Chenille, and Biggie,

00:07:30.085 --> 00:07:32.131
and Guy Diamond,
and Creek!

00:07:32.175 --> 00:07:33.263
Mmm.

00:07:33.306 --> 00:07:35.700
Which is why
I have to ask you.

00:07:35.743 --> 00:07:37.919
Will you go to Bergen Town
with me and save everyone?

00:07:37.963 --> 00:07:39.269
What? No.

00:07:39.312 --> 00:07:41.358
Branch, you can't say no.
They're your friends.

00:07:41.401 --> 00:07:43.229
Uh-uh-uh.
They're your friends.

00:07:43.273 --> 00:07:45.231
I'm staying right here
in my bunker where it's safe.

00:07:45.275 --> 00:07:46.972
Oh, that's great.

00:07:47.015 --> 00:07:48.539
You're the one guy who knows
more about Bergens
than anyone...

00:07:48.582 --> 00:07:49.714
but when
we finally need you,

00:07:49.757 --> 00:07:51.237
you just want
to hide here forever?

00:07:51.281 --> 00:07:53.805
Forever? Pfft. No.

00:07:53.848 --> 00:07:55.110
Oh!

00:07:55.676 --> 00:07:56.721
Yeah...

00:07:56.764 --> 00:07:57.896
I really only have
enough supplies

00:07:57.939 --> 00:08:00.246
down here
to last me 10 years...

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.944
11 if I'm willing to store
and drink my own sweat.

00:08:02.988 --> 00:08:04.555
Which I am.

00:08:04.598 --> 00:08:06.383
You all said
I was crazy, huh?

00:08:06.426 --> 00:08:08.776
Well, who's crazy now?

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.779
Me. Crazy prepared.

00:08:11.823 --> 00:08:13.955
I'm sorry.
I should have listened to you.

00:08:13.999 --> 00:08:15.653
You told me
not to throw the party,

00:08:15.696 --> 00:08:17.263
and I threw it anyway.

00:08:17.307 --> 00:08:18.786
And it's my fault
they were taken.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.614
And now
I don't know what to do.

00:08:20.658 --> 00:08:22.964
Why don't you try
scrapbooking them
to freedom?

00:08:23.965 --> 00:08:25.358
Solid burn, Branch.

00:08:27.142 --> 00:08:29.623
Well, thanks anyway.

00:08:29.667 --> 00:08:31.799
Hey, anytime, Poppy.
See you in 10 years.

